istItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"性能基準測試：利用 LiteSVM 的速度，在開發和 CI/CD 流程中運行全面的測試套件","position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":4,"offset":693},"end":{"line":20,"column":49,"offset":738}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":4,"offset":693},"end":{"line":20,"column":49,"offset":738}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":20,"column":1,"offset":690},"end":{"line":20,"column":49,"offset":738}}},{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"加入社群：在 Discord 上與其他使用 LiteSVM 的開發者交流，分享測試策略和優化方法","position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":4,"offset":743},"end":{"line":21,"column":52,"offset":791}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":4,"offset":743},"end":{"line":21,"column":52,"offset":791}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":21,"column":1,"offset":740},"end":{"line":21,"column":52,"offset":791}}},{"type":"listItem","spread":false,"checked":null,"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"保持更新：關注 ","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":4,"offset":796},"end":{"line":22,"column":12,"offset":804}}},{"type":"link","title":null,"url":"https://github.com/LiteSVM/litesvm","children":[{"type":"text","value":"LiteSVM 儲存庫","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":13,"offset":805},"end":{"line":22,"column":24,"offset":816}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":12,"offset":804},"end":{"line":22,"column":61,"offset":853}}},{"type":"text","value":"，了解最新功能、語言綁定和性能改進","position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":61,"offset":853},"end":{"line":22,"column":78,"offset":870}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":4,"offset":796},"end":{"line":22,"column":78,"offset":870}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":22,"column":1,"offset":793},"end":{"line":22,"column":78,"offset":870}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":18,"column":1,"offset":583},"end":{"line":22,"column":78,"offset":870}}},{"type":"blockquote","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"特別感謝 ","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":3,"offset":876},"end":{"line":24,"column":8,"offset":881}}},{"type":"link","title":null,"url":"https://x.com/exoaursen","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Aursen","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":9,"offset":882},"end":{"line":24,"column":15,"offset":888}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":8,"offset":881},"end":{"line":24,"column":41,"offset":914}}},{"type":"text","value":" 和 ","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":41,"offset":914},"end":{"line":24,"column":44,"offset":917}}},{"type":"link","title":null,"url":"https://x.com/exotic_markets_","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Exotic Markets","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":45,"offset":918},"end":{"line":24,"column":59,"offset":932}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":44,"offset":917},"end":{"line":24,"column":91,"offset":964}}},{"type":"text","value":" 團隊創建並維護 LiteSVM，讓高性能的 Solana 程式測試對多語言開發者變得觸手可及。","position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":91,"offset":964},"end":{"line":24,"column":139,"offset":1012}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":3,"offset":876},"end":{"line":24,"column":139,"offset":1012}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":24,"column":1,"offset":874},"end":{"line":24,"column":139,"offset":1012}}}],"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1,"offset":0},"end":{"line":24,"column":139,"offset":1012}}},"raw":"import { ArticleSection } from \"../../../../components/ArticleSection/ArticleSection\";\r\n\r\n# 結論\r\n\r\n恭喜你！你已完成「使用 LiteSVM 測試」課程。現在你已全面了解如何使用 LiteSVM，一個快速且輕量的測試框架，將 Solana 虛擬機直接引入你的測試流程，實現快速迭代和精確的程式測試。\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"你所學到的內容\" id=\"what-you-learned\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n在這個課程中，你掌握了 LiteSVM 的核心概念：\r\n- **性能優勢**：了解 LiteSVM 的內部虛擬機如何比傳統測試框架提供顯著更快的執行速度\r\n- **帳戶管理**：創建和配置系統帳戶、程式帳戶以及 SPL 代幣帳戶，以進行全面的測試場景\r\n- **交易執行**：設置、模擬和執行交易，並正確檢查結果\r\n- **進階控制**：操作系統變數、控制運行時行為以及自定義測試環境\r\n\r\n<ArticleSection name=\"下一步\" id=\"next-steps\" level=\"h2\" />\r\n\r\n現在你已具備使用 LiteSVM 為你的 Solana 程式構建快速且可靠測試的能力！以下是一些建議的下一步：\r\n1. 應用到你的項目：將 LiteSVM 整合到你現有的 Solana 程式測試套件中，親身體驗性能提升\r\n2. 探索進階測試：利用 LiteSVM 的帳戶操作功能，測試其他框架難以重現的複雜邊界情況和失敗場景\r\n3. 性能基準測試：利用 LiteSVM 的速度，在開發和 CI/CD 流程中運行全面的測試套件\r\n4. 加入社群：在 Discord 上與其他使用 LiteSVM 的開發者交流，分享測試策略和優化方法\r\n5. 保持更新：關注 [LiteSVM 儲存庫](https://github.com/LiteSVM/litesvm)，了解最新功能、語言綁定和性能改進\r\n\r\n> 特別感謝 [Aursen](https://x.com/exoaursen) 和 [Exotic Markets](https://x.com/exotic_markets_) 團隊創建並維護 LiteSVM，讓高性能的 Solana 程式測試對多語言開發者變得觸手可及。","highlightedCode":{}}